// 1-12: one swing into chained swings, merged.
id l1-12
name 1-12 CHAIN SWING
tagline one port. then many. keep moving.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main anchor current
mechanics current:6 anchor:3
new -
portion 4 first swing over current
portion 5 two anchors in a row
portion 6 three anchors over a long pit
hardness 5
map
