text NEXT PORT? LET GO, THEN {jack} AGAIN.\nRELEASE AT THE TOP OF THE SWING.\nSPEED IS FREE. GRAVITY IS A LOAN.
text BLUE PORT. HOLD {jack} TO HANG.\n{left}/{right} PUMPS THE SWING.\nLET GO TO FLY.
